   "reproduction": {
    "command": "bun -e 'import {sanitizePublication as s} from \"./src/gates/publication.ts\"; const D=\"/Users/example/.factory\", W=D+\"/work/run\"; for(const t of [`[f](file://${W}/a.ts)`,`file://${W}/a.ts`]) console.log(s(t,W,D));' A separate throwaway script created actual/work/run and a symlink alias under os.tmpdir(), then passed realpathSync(alias/work/run) and realpathSync(alias) paths to the sanitizer configured with alias roots.",
    "output": "[f](file:///Users/example/.factory/work/run/a.ts)\nfile:///Users/example/.factory/work/run/a.ts\nSymlink probe: {\"claim\":\"F3-canonical\",\"workAlias\":true,\"workUnchanged\":true,\"dataUnchanged\":true}"
